```\n\n```json\n{\n\t\"name\": \"my-awesome-project\",\n\t\"xo\": {\n\t\t\"extends\": \"xo-react\"\n\t}\n}\n``` -->\n\n## Related\n\n- [eslint-config-xo](https://github.com/xojs/eslint-config-xo) - ESLint shareable config for XO\n- [XO](https://github.com/xojs/xo)\n","readmeFilename":"readme.md","users":{"flumpus-dev":true}}